{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/b45388a9954421141e3a356ba7348708.poster.avif?t=1772168509\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/b45388a9954421141e3a356ba7348708.webm?t=1772168509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/b45388a9954421141e3a356ba7348708.mp4?t=1772168509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SNK\u2019s beloved Fatal Fury series first hit the market in 1991, spearheading the fighting game boom of the 1990s that swept the industry thereafter. GAROU: MARK OF THE WOLVES (released in 1999) has, for some time, served as the franchise\u2019s most recent installment. But that is all about to change: 26 years on, a brand-new entry\u2014FATAL FURY: City of the Wolves\u2014is set to arrive on the scene!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0All-new REV System supercharges the excitement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the REV System, a brand-new toolset that offers unique offensive options from the moment the battle begins! Use REV Arts, REV Accel, REV Blows (while S.P.G. is active), and more until you hit your limit and the REV Meter overheats. The all-new REV System\u2014fight at full throttle and supercharge the excitement! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Two control schemes\u2014fun for newcomers and veterans alike!<br>Choose from two control schemes: Arcade Style is based on precise, technical inputs, while Smart Style lets you perform flashy special moves and combos using directional inputs and single button presses. From fighting game newcomers to seasoned veterans, there\u2019s plenty of fun and excitement to be had\u2014tailored specifically to your level! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Memorable fighters from far and wide descend on the streets of South Town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action kicks off with a total of 22 characters: a diverse 17-member roster of familiar faces and new blood, plus five DLC fighters in Season Pass 1. Every character is vibrantly presented in CotW's unique art style, which is guaranteed to stimulate the senses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/bb49c5bb235a23913640d6cd0d24b047.avif?t=1772168509\" width=512 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Strive for supremacy in EPISODES OF SOUTH TOWN, a single-player RPG mode!<br>Introducing \u201cEpisodes of South Town\u201d (EOST)\u2014a solo RPG adventure where you\u2019ll square up against contenders under various fight conditions, earning XP and other rewards for your efforts. Level up your fighter, build out a diverse kit of skills, and dominate the opposition on your way to the top. Dreams and ambitions run rampant in South Town; now is the time to chase the city\u2019s crown and carve a legend all of your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* To play EOST you\u2019ll first need to connect to the Internet and update the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/6b40b8966668869583ddfbb203681693.avif?t=1772168509\" width=512 height=286 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"City of the Wolves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2492040/b94040f8bf740581212dcf17f6ad2b4cbfbf37a9.jpg"},{"name":"Gonna take you for a ride!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2492040/38576acbc6b4a671ba04afc097236816925fb4da.jpg"},{"name":"Well done! I commend you!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2492040/8cf9dcdee745de0136470f795ed73ec405f885df.jpg"},{"name":"Keep up the good work, partner!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2492040/45557903c89d18095f089b63207806ff95e53734.jpg"},{"name":"I'm the one who decides my fate!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2492040/b7a4ec81d777420ec60958d128e36438db915698.jpg"},{"name":"Let's make it a clean fight.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2492040/8cf9dcdee745de0136470f795ed73ec405f885df.jpg"},{"name":"I am invincible!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2492040/45557903c89d18095f089b63207806ff95e53734.jpg"},{"name":"You're really something!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2492040/45557903c89d18095f089b63207806ff95e53734.jpg"},{"name":"Not bad for a rookie.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2492040/38576acbc6b4a671ba04afc097236816925fb4da.jpg"},{"name":"Can you comprehend that?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2492040/38576acbc6b4a671ba04afc097236816925fb4da.jpg"}],"total":42},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2492040?t=1772168509","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/92ff0879b4f78319a2de1fe9ebd221ebd6379f66/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772168509","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/526c8440814b4307e7d0c2f687b2b3c38ba1f734/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772168509","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/526c8440814b4307e7d0c2f687b2b3c38ba1f734/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772168509","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Legend Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season Pass 2 is also available for individual purchase. Make sure you have the correct product at checkout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* FATAL FURY: City of the Wolves is only available in this Legend Edition format.<br>* There are no plans at this time to sell the base game and Season Pass 1 individually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/a87454d603153669e54e9bfff2e38ad6.poster.avif?t=1772168509\" width=512 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/a87454d603153669e54e9bfff2e38ad6.webm?t=1772168509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/a87454d603153669e54e9bfff2e38ad6.mp4?t=1772168509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Contents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season Pass 1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-DLC  Andy Bogard<br>-DLC  Ken, Additional Stage<br>-DLC  Joe Higashi<br>-DLC  Chun-Li<br>-DLC  Mr. Big, Additional stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season Pass 2</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- DLC Kim Jae Hoon, Additional stage<br>- DLC Nightmare Geese (Winter 2026)<br>- DLC Blue Mary (Spring 2026)<br>- DLC Wolfgang Krauser (Spring 2026)<br>- DLC Character 5 (Spring 2026)<br>- DLC Character 6 (Summer 2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/e192835cbb2dea2d914c9018fdb90588.avif?t=1772168509\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Release date estimates are current at the time of publication.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/b45388a9954421141e3a356ba7348708.poster.avif?t=1772168509\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/b45388a9954421141e3a356ba7348708.webm?t=1772168509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/b45388a9954421141e3a356ba7348708.mp4?t=1772168509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SNK\u2019s beloved Fatal Fury series first hit the market in 1991, spearheading the fighting game boom of the 1990s that swept the industry thereafter. GAROU: MARK OF THE WOLVES (released in 1999) has, for some time, served as the franchise\u2019s most recent installment. But that is all about to change: 26 years on, a brand-new entry\u2014FATAL FURY: City of the Wolves\u2014is set to arrive on the scene!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0All-new REV System supercharges the excitement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the REV System, a brand-new toolset that offers unique offensive options from the moment the battle begins! Use REV Arts, REV Accel, REV Blows (while S.P.G. is active), and more until you hit your limit and the REV Meter overheats. The all-new REV System\u2014fight at full throttle and supercharge the excitement! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Two control schemes\u2014fun for newcomers and veterans alike!<br>Choose from two control schemes: Arcade Style is based on precise, technical inputs, while Smart Style lets you perform flashy special moves and combos using directional inputs and single button presses. From fighting game newcomers to seasoned veterans, there\u2019s plenty of fun and excitement to be had\u2014tailored specifically to your level! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Memorable fighters from far and wide descend on the streets of South Town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action kicks off with a total of 22 characters: a diverse 17-member roster of familiar faces and new blood, plus five DLC fighters in Season Pass 1. Every character is vibrantly presented in CotW's unique art style, which is guaranteed to stimulate the senses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/bb49c5bb235a23913640d6cd0d24b047.avif?t=1772168509\" width=512 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Strive for supremacy in EPISODES OF SOUTH TOWN, a single-player RPG mode!<br>Introducing \u201cEpisodes of South Town\u201d (EOST)\u2014a solo RPG adventure where you\u2019ll square up against contenders under various fight conditions, earning XP and other rewards for your efforts. Level up your fighter, build out a diverse kit of skills, and dominate the opposition on your way to the top. Dreams and ambitions run rampant in South Town; now is the time to chase the city\u2019s crown and carve a legend all of your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* To play EOST you\u2019ll first need to connect to the Internet and update the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/extras/6b40b8966668869583ddfbb203681693.avif?t=1772168509\" width=512 height=286 /></span></p>","developers":["SNK CORPORATION"],"dlc":[4070950],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492040/6d9da7fcf3b1e190be4c01c694d268cd6d0f7316/header.jpg?t=1772168509","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 SNK CORPORATION ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":80,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/fatal-fury-city-of-the-wolves?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2492040/1520378576/27c443979c2152704a8a5a6d5e79f057cd03f4d6/1772167748/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772168507","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2492040/1520378576/27c443979c2152704a8a5a6d5e79f057cd03f4d6/1772167748/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772168507","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2492040/1520378576/27c443979c2152704a8a5a6d5e79f057cd03f4d6/1772167748/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772168507","id":257295270,"name":"Geese_trailer_en","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257295270/aa5859fc25b083034b055fef5a2c2a08a896a889/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772168507"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2492040/890254813/dbaa81c3f7b591abb4d9d526e935e1a4fb60fba6/1769071326/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769074331","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2492040/890254813/dbaa81c3f7b591abb4d9d526e935e1a4fb60fba6/1769071326/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769074331","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2492040/890254813/dbaa81c3f7b59